  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Rule - is a card answered as before","summary":"A card comes whose people remember how she answered it the last time. Is it answered the same way by itself, with a line in the log, or does the card come up for her? The game asks this graph as the card is about to open (GameRules.AsBefore, from EncounterDirector.OpenNext). Which cards, and which of their answers may stand, is in Game/Data/card_rules_793.json.","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"fbdd8c9e-93f0-4f89-9f84-5d4d7e16d2a1","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.AsBeforeRule","$id":"9"},{"how":"AtLeast","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.5,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"ba2999da-6821-42ca-bbf7-f5a5ba80f52c","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"11"},{"how":"AtLeast","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.5,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":180.0},"guid":"0c5b8fbc-8a4f-4338-825f-59edde00ef92","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"13"},{"how":"AtLeast","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.5,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":360.0},"guid":"e349f884-d52a-44ea-8aed-3b852e0d69aa","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"15"},{"how":"FirstAndNotSecond","defaultValues":{"one":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"other":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":840.0,"y":80.0},"guid":"ba34d04d-7f6e-43f0-aa03-11c04094418e","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.BothOrEither","$id":"17"},{"how":"FirstAndNotSecond","defaultValues":{"one":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"other":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":1280.0,"y":180.0},"guid":"32f5cbd9-71f2-44b1-ab66-d8c9d1b6f4ad","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.BothOrEither","$id":"19"},{"defaultValues":{"when":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"yes":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"no":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":1720.0,"y":180.0},"guid":"a99b6e7d-e63d-41d3-a806-ebe58de1069e","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.ThisOrThat","$id":"21"},{"defaultValues":{"number":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":2040.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"a245fc81-a248-4a95-9848-57bbc1767750","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.RuleAnswer","$id":"23"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"23"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"bb9a78e0-ea7c-45d9-bb5d-9b140474651c","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"stands","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"8a545043-fc1e-45bf-bfa3-cfedca65785d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"better","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"a5b7dfda-75a7-41cb-a4e5-a6d1c24129d3","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"meets","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"8ae248ad-814f-4010-bfae-7d75bfa8247d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"one","guid":"6c79546b-8197-464a-91ba-2a436e4e61e1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"other","guid":"f73a8b4e-3822-4274-802e-cb693fb9e03a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"one","guid":"3309bf7b-94a7-471e-b367-7e06be8ebcd5","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"other","guid":"2418b6a5-596c-42d4-b5cc-bdd339c442c2","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"21"},"destinationKey":"when","guid":"622484da-e643-4451-a990-d154ab19c3b2","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"21"},"sourceKey":"picked","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"23"},"destinationKey":"number","guid":"b980ac2a-2d68-4253-8622-b5322be2a50e","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-80.0,"xMax":2400.0,"yMax":680.0},"label":"Is a card answered as before","comment":"Your ruling of 10 October 2026, of the king''s toll: \"As you answered last time\". It is, when her last answer may stand; unless a better answer is open to her today, or something brings them to her in person.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"63fcf0d7-2056-45ca-916c-e795fbede7e7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":650.0},"title":"What the game gives, for the king''s toll","body":"Her last answer stands: the toll man remembers that she declared her cargo, or showed a charter, and she can do the same today. A better answer is open: she declared the last time and holds a charter now. Something brings them: there are swords or captives aboard, which she might hide.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"9140179c-4f42-4d62-8e6b-d85096c45bc3","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
